			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Convert module header comments to rustdoc in Eliminate module\n\nReplace the verbose C-style block comment banners (`//=====//`) across all 14 files in the Eliminate module and its Transform submodule with idiomatic Rust doc comments (`//!`).\n\n- `mod.rs`: Collapse 40+ lines of architectural boilerplate into a compact rustdoc with a submodule purpose table and Algo-style references for the two entry points (`Run`, `RunPreserve`).\n- `Transform/mod.rs`: Provide a concise module overview with a submodule reference table linking to each transformer's purpose.\n- `Count.rs`, `Inline.rs`, `Patch.rs`, `Safe.rs`: Strip full declarative algorithm headers and compress into compact `//!` summaries that preserve the essential design rationale without re-stating the implementation.\n- `CLI.rs`, `Constant.rs`, `Definition.rs`, `Error.rs`, `Fn.rs`, `Logger.rs`, `Process.rs`: Replace single-line C-style headers with corresponding `//!` module docs.\n\nThese changes improve code clarity without altering any runtime behaviour.",
